Files derived from Athenaion (copied, then changed where noted):
  index.html, src/main.js, src/test/testScene.js         (titles, default frame size; the boot of the explorable world
                                                           in index.html and main.js is ours)
  src/core/engine.js                                      (per-sample jitter of the PCF shadow-tap noise)
  src/core/lighting.js                                    (shadow-tap radius off when soft shadows accumulate)
  src/core/atmosphere.js, sky.js, materials.js, glsl.js, noise.js, rng.js,
           quality.js, cache.js, footprints.js, pipeline.js
  src/water/surface.js                                    (the two-pass surface, FFT octaves, LEAN roughness, foam texture
                                                           and premultiplied fog; the lake features are ours: wind patches,
                                                           multi-tap mirror, unfolded-path haze, glitter, wakes, ice, bore)
  src/water/spray.js                                      (the spray / mist particle kinds and shading of water/mist.js;
                                                           the moving frame for the tidal bore is ours)
  src/water/reflection.js                                 (near-plane clip bias: no underwater geometry in the mirror)
  src/water/heightmap.js, ocean.js
  src/water/ground.js                                     (makeGround, taken out of Athenaion's water/trace.js)
  src/water/flow.js                                       (the flow-map encoding and texture set-up of water/flow.js;
                                                           the still-lake drift field is ours)
  src/modules/water.js, src/modules/mist.js               (the module wiring of modules/water.js and the premultiplied
                                                           atmosphere blending of water/mist.js; the lake, canals,
                                                           river and mist sheet are ours)
  src/video/player.js, src/video/sequence.js              (the sequence itself is ours)
  src/world/index.js, src/world/looks.js                  (module runner and look helpers; the content is ours)
  src/world/heightfield.js                                (the 2D distance helpers only)
  tools/render.mjs, session.mjs, snap.mjs, serve.mjs, render-video.mjs, crop.mjs,
        colorstats.mjs, satstats.mjs, sample.mjs, bake.mjs
                                                          (macOS Chrome launch, references read from shots.js)
  src/vegetation/util.js         (GeoBuilder, blob / card / tube / billboard helpers from vegetation/util.js; ribbons are ours)
  src/vegetation/atlas.js        (the coverage-preserving mip chain and patch stamping from vegetation/atlas.js;
                                  every drawing is ours)
  src/vegetation/materials.js    (foliage / bark / impostor / wind-depth shaders from materials/foliage.js and the
                                  thin-leaf translucency from flora/foliage.js; seasons, snow, ribbons are ours)
  src/vegetation/system.js       (the per-camera LOD instancing of vegetation/instances.js)
  src/vegetation/trees.js        (the recursive skeleton → LOD scheme of vegetation/trees.js; species, pine tufts,
                                  peach blossom are ours)
  src/vegetation/library.js      (structure of vegetation/library.js)
  src/vegetation/ground.js       (grass-tuft cards and the vine-over-an-edge idea after flora/ground.js and flora/ivy.js)
  src/sculpt/sdf.js              (SDF primitives, smooth operators, value noise and the bounded Group from sculpt/sdf.js
                                  and ruins/sdf.js; the cellular helper with feature offsets is ours)
  src/sculpt/mesher.js           (surface nets with block-sparse narrow-band sampling, Newton projection and gradient
                                  normals from sculpt/mesher.js; the SDF ambient-occlusion / cavity bake from
                                  sculpt/bakeutil.js; clipping for nested regions, the origin offset and aRock are ours)
  src/sculpt/budai.js            (the modelling technique of sculpt/face.js and sculpt/figure.js: smooth unions of
                                  ellipsoids and tapered capsules, carved features, the irregular tube-fold field;
                                  the 布袋弥勒 itself is ours)
  src/karst/material.js          (STONE_GLSL of materials/stone.js: band-limited fbm, cellular facets and joints,
                                  surface-gradient bump, crust, pitting, lichen, moss, wetness; carved surfaces,
                                  rain streaks, snow and the tuff palette are ours)
  src/karst/rock.js              (createRock of materials/stone.js: fracture-plane hull on an icosphere, joint grooves,
                                  bedding, Laplacian cavity; the aRock output and the 太湖石 SDF are ours)
  src/bake/karst.js              (the skip-when-baked pattern of bake/head.js; the worker pool is ours)

Everything else is original to this project, including src/yingzao/ (the 营造法式 generator), src/ink/ (the ink
painter), src/explore/ (the explorable world), src/city/, src/karst/ (except the parts noted above), src/terrain/,
src/world/layout.js, src/world/shots.js, the other src/modules/ and the other tools/.

